<view class="page"><view class="brand">CANWISE LAW</view><view class="title">预约法律咨询</view><view>60 分钟 · CAD $350 / 小时</view><view class="notice">提交后须人工确认。我们会联系你确认，费用另行安排。</view><view class="card"><text>日期（多伦多时间）</text><picker disabled="{{pending || busy}}" mode="date" bindchange="onDate" value="{{date}}"><view class="field">{{date || '选择日期'}}</view></picker><button disabled="{{pending || busy}}" bindtap="load">查看可申请时间</button><picker disabled="{{pending || busy}}" wx:if="{{labels.length}}" range="{{labels}}" bindchange="slot"><view class="field">{{slotIndex >= 0 ? labels[slotIndex] : '选择时间'}}</view></picker><form bindsubmit="submit"><text>称呼</text><input disabled="{{pending || busy}}" name="name" maxlength="80" placeholder="如何称呼你"/><text>联系方式</text><picker disabled="{{pending || busy}}" range="{{contactTypes}}" bindchange="contactType"><view class="field">{{contactTypes[contactIndex]}}</view></picker><input disabled="{{pending || busy}}" name="contact" maxlength="160" placeholder="微信号、邮箱或电话"/><view class="small">请勿提交证件、案号或详细案情。信息用于安排咨询，保存在腾讯云 CloudBase，获授权的 Muse 助手可读取预约及联系方式并向工作人员报告。删除请求请联系 admin@canwiselaw.com。</view><checkbox-group name="consent"><label><checkbox disabled="{{pending || busy}}" value="yes"/>同意为安排咨询处理信息，并理解须人工确认。</label></checkbox-group><button form-type="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{pending ? '核实提交结果' : '提交申请'}}</button></form><view class="message">{{message}}</view></view></view>
